<section class="auth-page" aria-labelledby="login-title">
  <div class="auth-card">
    <div class="auth-brand">
      <span class="auth-brand-mark"><i class="mdi mdi-car-connected"></i></span>
      <div>
        <p class="auth-eyebrow">特友会</p>
        <h1 id="login-title">欢迎回来</h1>
        <p>登录后只会看到与你账号绑定的车辆。</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <%= if @error do %>
      <div class="auth-alert" role="alert"><%= @error %></div>
    <% end %>

    <%= form_for @conn, Routes.user_session_path(@conn, :create),
      [as: :user, class: "auth-form"], fn f -> %>
      <div class="field">
        <%= label(f, :email, "邮箱", class: "label") %>
        <div class="control has-icons-left">
          <%= email_input(f, :email,
            value: @email,
            required: true,
            autocomplete: "username",
            inputmode: "email",
            class: "input",
            placeholder: "name@example.com"
          ) %>
          <span class="icon is-left"><i class="mdi mdi-email-outline"></i></span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="field">
        <%= label(f, :password, "密码", class: "label") %>
        <div class="control has-icons-left">
          <%= password_input(f, :password,
            required: true,
            autocomplete: "current-password",
            class: "input",
            placeholder: "至少 12 位"
          ) %>
          <span class="icon is-left"><i class="mdi mdi-lock-outline"></i></span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <.turnstile conn={@conn} action="login" email={@email} />
      <%= submit("登录", class: "button is-primary is-fullwidth auth-submit") %>
    <% end %>

    <%= if TeslaMate.Accounts.sign_up_allowed?() do %>
      <p class="auth-switch">
        还没有账号？ <%= link("创建账号", to: Routes.user_registration_path(@conn, :new)) %>
      </p>
    <% end %>
  </div>

  <footer class="auth-privacy" aria-labelledby="login-privacy-title">
    <h2 id="login-privacy-title">
      <i class="mdi mdi-shield-lock-outline" aria-hidden="true"></i>
      隐私协议 <span lang="en">Privacy Policy</span>
    </h2>
    <p lang="zh-Hans">
      车辆数据仅用于本系统的分析与必要改进。我们不会公开、出售或通过其他渠道分享、共享您的车辆数据；必要服务处理详见下方说明。
    </p>
    <p lang="en">
      Vehicle data is used only for analysis and necessary improvements within this system. We do not publish, sell, or share it through other channels. Essential service processing is explained below.
    </p>

    <details class="auth-privacy-details">
      <summary>阅读完整说明 <span lang="en">Read the full notice</span></summary>
      <div class="auth-privacy-content">
        <section lang="zh-Hans" aria-labelledby="privacy-zh-title">
          <h3 id="privacy-zh-title">中文</h3>
          <p>
            <strong>数据与用途。</strong>特友会处理您授权车辆的位置、行程、能耗、充电、电池及温度等数据，仅用于本系统内的数据展示、分析、故障排查和必要的功能改进，不用于广告营销或与本系统无关的用途。
          </p>
          <p>
            <strong>访问与共享。</strong>普通用户只能访问归属于自己账号的车辆数据，管理员按系统管理职责访问。除下述必要服务处理及法律要求外，我们不会将车辆数据公开展示、出售、交换，或通过其他渠道向其他用户、平台或机构分享、共享。
          </p>
          <p>
            <strong>必要服务处理。</strong>车辆连接依赖 Tesla 的授权与车辆接口；地图显示和地址解析可能向所配置的地图服务（如高德、OpenStreetMap）及 Nominatim 地址服务提供相关坐标或地图请求。启用 Cloudflare Turnstile 人机验证时，Cloudflare 会处理必要的 IP 地址、浏览器及验证信息。上述服务仅用于实现相关功能，不代表车辆历史记录会被公开发布或供其他用户共享。
          </p>
          <p>
            <strong>授权与历史数据。</strong>您可在「Tesla 连接」管理车辆授权，在「账号设置」管理登录设备或申请注销。按当前系统规则，注销账号不会自动删除车辆历史；解除账号绑定后，保留的历史仅管理员可见。如对数据使用有疑问，请联系本系统管理员。
          </p>
        </section>

        <section lang="en" aria-labelledby="privacy-en-title">
          <h3 id="privacy-en-title">English</h3>
          <p>
            <strong>Data and purposes.</strong>
            TeYouHui processes data from vehicles you authorize, including location, trips, energy consumption, charging, battery status, and temperatures. It is used only for this system's displays, analysis, troubleshooting, and necessary feature improvements, not for advertising or unrelated purposes.
          </p>
          <p>
            <strong>Access and sharing.</strong>
            Regular users can access only vehicles assigned to their own accounts. Administrators have access for system administration. Except for the essential services described below and disclosures required by law, we do not publish, sell, exchange, or share vehicle data with other users, platforms, or organizations through other channels.
          </p>
          <p>
            <strong>Essential service processing.</strong>
            Vehicle connections use Tesla's authorization and vehicle APIs. Map display and address lookup may send relevant coordinates or map requests to the configured map service, such as AMap or OpenStreetMap, and to the Nominatim address service. When Cloudflare Turnstile is enabled, Cloudflare processes the IP address, browser information, and verification data needed for security checks. These services support the relevant features; they do not make your vehicle history public or available for other users to share.
          </p>
          <p>
            <strong>Authorization and historical records.</strong>
            You can manage vehicle authorization in Tesla Connection, and manage signed-in devices or request account deletion in Account Settings. Under the current system rules, deleting an account does not automatically delete vehicle history. Once the account's vehicle assignments are removed, retained history is accessible only to administrators. Contact the system administrator with any questions about data use.
          </p>
        </section>
        <p class="auth-privacy-updated">更新日期 / <span lang="en">Updated</span>：2026-09-19</p>
      </div>
    </details>
  </footer>
</section>
